   "default_branch": "develop",
   "description": "万信安卓版，是Element X的分支，它适应了中国的网络环境和中国人的使用习惯。它能阅后即焚，能自动安装ntfy并用来做通知提醒，能定期测试通知推送，并在必要时唤醒ntfy。wanchat Android is a fork of Element X Android, adapts to China's network environment and Chinese users' habits. Supports self‑destructing messages, use ntfy for notification reminders,  periodically test push loop,  and wake up ntfy if necessary.",
